	"menu": ["Peace upon you, Captain. What is it?", "Ah, the sea-wanderer. Speak, before the heat takes my patience.",
		"Come into the shade, Captain. What do you need?", "You've sand on your boots and a question on your face. Ask.",
		"Welcome, welcome. Sit if you like. What brings you over?", "Captain! I was hoping a strong arm would wander by. Well?",
		"Water first? No? Then talk. I'm listening.", "Ha, the pirate everyone's whispering about. What can I do for you?",
		"Quickly, Captain. The sun moves, and my shade with it.", "May your well never run dry. Now, what's on your mind?",
		"Another foreigner, red as a pepper. What is it, friend?"],
	"work_menu": "So, friend, what's your trade? How's life treating you out in all this sand?",
	"bye": "Go in shade.",
	"rumour_menu": ["What's the word on this island?", "Heard anything about the islands ahead?"],
	"rumour_isle": {
		"camp": ["They say {name} buried something out on the flats before he made camp. The sand moves, though. So does what's buried.",
			"{name}'s crew raid the caravans on moonless nights. Brave men, robbing people who've already lost everything to the desert."],
		"beast": ["{name} came up out of the deep sand three moons back. It doesn't eat people. It just doesn't like them standing on it.",
			"Nobody crosses to the far side any more. {name} rules there. Big as a house, the guides say, and it hears your feet."],
		"lair": ["The things in the burrows click before a storm. Louder every year. One day the whole dune will get up and walk."],
		"ruins": ["The old city was here before the first ship. The sand took it in a single night, they say. It's still giving bits back."],
		"lookout": ["Climb the lookout on a clear day and you'll see three islands. On a hazy day you'll see one, and it'll be the wrong one."],
		"any": ["Something's not right out at {name}. Nobody says what. Nobody goes to look, either.", "My uncle went out to {name} once. Came back with a story and no camel. Still won't say which he misses more."],
