	"rumour_chain": [
		"Ships that make it to {name} come back quiet. {blurb}, they say, and meaner than here.",
		"A trader swore {name} has more gold than people. Then he went back, and now it has one more person.",
		"The needle pulls toward {name} next. {blurb}. Take water. Take more water than that.",
		"I've a cousin on {name}. Haven't heard from him in a year. That's normal for him. Probably.",
	],
	"rumour_quiet": ["Quiet island, this. The wind does all the talking.", "Nothing worth the telling. Just sand, sun and the price of water.",
		"Rumours? Only that it's hot. That one's true.", "I hear nothing. Too busy keeping the sand out of my ears.",
		"The camels know more than I do, and they aren't talking.", "Not a whisper this week. Even the gossips are too hot to bother.",
		"Nothing new under this sun. Truly nothing. I've checked.", "If I'd heard a thing, I'd have sold it to the spice merchant by now. I've heard nothing."],
	"rumour_fork": "The sea splits past here: {a}, or {b}. Pick one. The sand will tell you if you chose wrong.",
	"rumour_end": "Past us? Nothing, the old ones say. The sea just ends, and something waits at the edge of it.",
	"rumour_hard": "Harder country than this, mind. Their scorpions eat our scorpions.",
	"self_menu": "Tell me about yourself.",
	"accept": "I'll see to it.",
	"decline": "Not now.",
	"taken": ["Good. I'll be right here, in the shade.", "Bless you, Captain. Go carefully, and take water.",
		"Truly? Then I owe you already. Go, before the sun climbs.", "You've a good heart under all that salt. I'll be waiting.",
		"Ha! I knew you had the look. Off you go.", "May the wind keep the sand out of your eyes. Go well.",
		"Done, then. Shake on it. Your hand's hot. Everyone's is.", "Don't keep me waiting long. Patience melts out here.",
		"Thank you. I'll tell the whole souk a pirate said yes.", "Then it's in your hands. Strong hands, I hope.",
		"Go, Captain. I'll keep a cup of cool water for your return."],
